    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d22">

                <pb facs="0108" n="1068" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1068"/>

                <head>No. 735.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Hubbard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-04-16"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 16,
                        1888</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 206.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose for your information and files a
                    copy of my letter to Mr. George Cowie, attorney, dated the 13th instant,
                    reviewing the <hi rendition="#italic">Monitor</hi> claim against Japan, and
                    concluding that this Government could not consistently press it further upon
                    that Empire.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. F. Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d22-a1.xml" xpointer="d22-a1"/>
            </div>
